WEBVTT

00:24:28.960 --> 00:24:32.029
There are some researchers
who put those habits to good use.

00:24:32.053 --> 00:24:35.381
They can predict burnout
by analyzing email patterns.

00:24:35.727 --> 00:24:38.977
Recent studies suggest that the volume
of emails you send and receive

00:24:39.001 --> 00:24:41.446
is unrelated to your emotional exhaustion,

00:24:41.470 --> 00:24:44.566
as long as email is key to doing your job.

00:24:44.590 --> 00:24:47.226
But if email doesn't really help you
get your work done,

00:24:47.250 --> 00:24:50.303
you feel the burden
of being boxed in by your inbox.

00:24:51.570 --> 00:24:52.720
If you're a surgeon,

00:24:52.744 --> 00:24:55.756
email is rarely critical
to your operations.

00:24:55.780 --> 00:24:58.586
In hospitals, digital demands
come in the dreaded form

00:24:58.610 --> 00:25:01.076
of electronic health records.